      
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INTEREST.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 N PIC  9(5).
01 I PIC  9(5).
01 ACCOUNT-ID PIC X(10).
01 BALANCE PIC 9(7).
01 RATE PIC 99.
01 INTEREST PIC 9(7)V99.
01 TOTAL PIC 9(9)V99 VALUE 0.
01 OUT-INTEREST PIC Z(6)9.99.
01 OUT-TOTAL PIC Z(8)9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT N

    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1
        UNTIL I > N

        ACCEPT ACCOUNT-ID
        ACCEPT BALANCE
        ACCEPT RATE

        COMPUTE INTEREST ROUNDED =
            BALANCE * RATE / 1200

        ADD INTEREST TO TOTAL

        MOVE INTEREST TO OUT-INTEREST

        DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(ACCOUNT-ID)
            " " FUNCTION TRIM(OUT-INTEREST)

    END-PERFORM

    MOVE TOTAL TO OUT-TOTAL
    DISPLAY "Total interest: "
        FUNCTION TRIM(OUT-TOTAL)

    STOP RUN.
